+        // non-empty, emit one `catch ptr @<typeinfo>` clause
+        // per entry, then a final `catch ptr null` catch-all.
+        //
+        // Returns `(exception_ptr, small_index)`. The
+        // landingpad's raw `i32` selector is an opaque
+        // personality-assigned type-id; we translate it via
+        // `llvm.eh.typeid.for(@<typeinfo>)` into a
+        // **small 1-based index**:
+        //
+        //   - 1..=N for each typed clause (matching the
+        //     `typeinfos` slice order)
+        //   - 0 for the catch-all (no typed match)
+        //
